    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n5:38 am from Evans Station to 18th & California Station\r\n8:55 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station to 18th & California Station\r\n10:40 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station to 18th & California Station\r\n12:25 pm from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station to 18th & California Station\r\n2:10 pm from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station to 18th & California Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n6:03 am from 18th & Stout Station to Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n7:48 am from 18th & Stout Station to Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n9:33 am from 18th & Stout Station to Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n11:18 am from 18th & Stout Station to Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n1:03 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Littleton / Mineral Ave Station"
